PDO_MYSQL for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module pdo_mysql of
php81-pdo_mysql, the same build, with php81-mysqlnd-openssl instead of
php81-mysqlnd. The same files as php81-pdo_mysql: install one of the
two.

The module pdo_mysql of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/pdo_mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d,
its headers in include/php81/php/ext/pdo_mysql.
